            <title>1.4.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 13:12:27 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>10</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Lina 1.4.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>Ringtone for incoming calls: four sounds, adjustable volume, a soft beep during another call, silent in Do Not Disturb.</li>
<li>Ready-made account types: FRITZ!Box, Freebox, 1&amp;1, Linphone, Placetel, sipgate, Telekom and Zadarma. Lina fills in the server and transport and tells you where to find your credentials.</li>
<li>New optional authentication name, needed by Telekom (e-mail address).</li>
<li>After saving an account, the editor shows “Online” or why it failed, with the fix to try.</li>
<li>Fixed a crash 30 seconds after editing or deleting an account whose server did not answer.</li>
<li>Quick hold then resume: the call now resumes.</li>
<li>Keyboard shortcuts: Return to answer, Esc to decline, ⇧⌘H to hang up, ⇧⌘M to mute, digits sent during a call, ⌘1 to ⌘6 for the sections.</li>
<li>An incoming call shows the window without taking the keyboard from the app you are using.</li>
<li>Lines register again as soon as the network changes (Wi-Fi, VPN).</li>
<li>Menu bar: why a line failed, and a Call back menu.</li>
<li>Clearer error messages, in your language.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
