            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Lina 1.3.1</h2>
<ul>
<li>Accounts: when registration fails, the reason is now shown in your language and in plain words (wrong password, provider not responding…), instead of a French or technical message.</li>
<li>A refused transfer now gives its reason in your language too.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
